'''Sen Bennex''' was a [[human]] [[Jedi Knight]]<ref name="TVG" /> that lived during the [[High Republic Era]].<ref name="Trivia">{{SW|url=day-trivia-gallery-the-acolyte|text="Day" Trivia Gallery &#124; The Acolyte}} {{C|Slide 5}}</ref> In [[132 BBY]],<ref name="Date" /> Bennex was briefed by [[Jedi Knight]] [[Yord Fandar]] on a [[Mission to Khofar|mission]] to [[Khofar]] to locate secluded [[Jedi Master]] [[Kelnacca]].<ref name="Day" />

Bennex accompanied a team led by [[Jedi Master]] [[Sol]] through the forests of Khofar in search of Kelnacca. As night began to fall, the team eventually reached [[Kelnacca's shelter]] and demanded the surrender of anyone inside. Unbeknownst to them, a mysterious [[The Stranger|stranger]] approached them from behind. Bennex ignited his [[lightsaber]] in response to the Stranger drawing his [[The Stranger's lightsaber|blade]]. Charging him, Bennex was flung back by a powerful [[Force push]]. In the ensuing battle, Bennex's blade was shorted-out by the Stranger's [[cortosis gauntlet]]. After regaining the use of his lightsaber, Bennex was promptly cut down by the Stranger.<ref name="Night">{{Acolyte|Night}}</ref>

{{Char-stub}}

==Equipment==
Sen Bennex wore brown [[Jedi apparel]] with gold accents, and wielded a [[lightsaber]] with a [[Color|yellow]] blade.<ref name="Day" />

==Behind the scenes==
The Jedi, albeit unidentified, first appeared in "[[Day (episode)|Day]],"<ref name="Day" /> the fourth episode of the live-action series ''[[Star Wars: The Acolyte]]'', which premiered [[June 18]], [[2024]].<ref name="EPG">{{SW|url=series/the-acolyte/season-1-episode-4-day-episode-guide|text="Day" Episode Guide &#124; The Acolyte}}</ref>  He was later identified as Sen Bennex in the reference book ''[[Star Wars: The Acolyte: The Visual Guide]]''.<ref name="TVG" />

